#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100599 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "667ac53c-36b8-56a0-9699-fe27c8373c6b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices"}] :question/id #uuid "0928c2fa-a772-5d39-a638-1b1d0e71be2f" :question/math-academy-id "e-4378" :question/problem "Calculate $A-(B-C),$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1-0 & -1-(-5) \\\\ 2-1 & 0-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1-(-1) & 0-4 \\\\ 2-1 & -2-(-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100600 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16e62b0e-adda-5d35-aeb9-961057dce8f0" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices Using Distributivity"}] :question/id #uuid "1b15db42-aba2-575c-a01e-b715450329fd" :question/math-academy-id "e-4379" :question/problem "Find $A+C-(B+A),$ if\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+C-(B+A) & =A+C-B-A \\\\  & =\\cancel{A}+C-B-\\cancel{A} \\\\  & =C-B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C-B & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3-3 & -1-(-1) \\\\ 1-2 & 2-0 \\\\ -6-(-4) & 1-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101044 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16e62b0e-adda-5d35-aeb9-961057dce8f0" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices Using Distributivity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9d0d5b8b-4428-5073-8c81-ebd4d03f5e11" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098035} {:answer/id #uuid "04d70404-4b26-53f0-9c5c-5e44fe5b9647" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098036} {:answer/id #uuid "39e8426c-e203-5fdf-a93f-111238c8159f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098037} {:answer/id #uuid "71f20d62-7872-5e37-97e9-a23e08aef59f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098038} {:answer/id #uuid "75cc67b5-2545-59dc-9edf-f9e64c9bb09e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098039}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04d70404-4b26-53f0-9c5c-5e44fe5b9647" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098036} :answer-field/id #uuid "11b67b69-785c-5ae0-bd01-ea693dbbfc6c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098034}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "60ff0898-484c-5468-ab70-2a2b8951960b" :question/math-academy-id "q-13536" :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278628 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16e62b0e-adda-5d35-aeb9-961057dce8f0" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices Using Distributivity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b4d37ae6-592b-5ba1-abeb-5285256fae98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278630} {:answer/id #uuid "15c71df8-67c0-52a9-b264-ece777f7e016" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278631} {:answer/id #uuid "6e5682f3-5d91-5a1c-8375-5bed7cf02971" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278632} {:answer/id #uuid "01197bfc-397e-5d8a-814c-f0c13b8935ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278633} {:answer/id #uuid "53a33146-e31b-5da9-831b-dc967160a799" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278634}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "53a33146-e31b-5da9-831b-dc967160a799" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278634} :answer-field/id #uuid "0016826a-ee2a-5b66-adb2-92ceeca908a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278629}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "86a3b4fd-ea74-58ac-945b-0f03af506f5a" :question/math-academy-id "q-13543" :question/problem "Find $M+O-(N+M)$, if\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,N=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}],\\,O=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 6 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M+O-(N+M) & =M+O-N-M \\\\  & =\\cancel{M}+O-N-\\cancel{M} \\\\  & =O-N\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}O-N & =[\\begin{aligned}8 & 6 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8-1 & 6-4 \\\\ 5-2 & 3-(-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278635 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "667ac53c-36b8-56a0-9699-fe27c8373c6b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d4acd8f6-cd3a-5272-b2b4-7707091d58de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278637} {:answer/id #uuid "4f814dee-e593-528f-8339-67dae17f1a12" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278638}] :answer-field/corre